msgstr "访问密钥已配置"

msgid "Address, status and updates for the panel. Updating the panel needs no service restart; the first install, and any change to the panel directory (ui), needs one."
msgstr "面板的地址、状态与更新。更新面板无需重启服务；首次安装、或改动 honk 的面板目录（ui）时需要重启服务。"

