msgstr "替换面板目录失败"

msgid "Set a panel directory on the API Settings page first"
msgstr "先在 API 设置里指定面板目录"

msgid "The checksum did not match"
msgstr "校验和不匹配"

msgid "The configured panel directory is not a usable absolute path"
msgstr "配置的面板目录不是可用的绝对路径"

msgid "The directory %s was not installed from this page. Updating replaces its contents with the official release and keeps no copy of the current files."
msgstr "%s 不是本页安装的。更新会用官方 release 的文件替换目录内现有内容，不保留副本。"

msgid "The download failed"
msgstr "下载失败"

msgid "The downloaded archive is not usable"
msgstr "下载的归档不可用"

msgid "The honk service is disabled"
msgstr "honk 服务未启用"

msgid "The native API listener is disabled"
msgstr "native API 监听未启用"

msgid "The native_api block is commented out or missing"
msgstr "native_api 配置块被注释掉或不存在"

msgid "The panel directory does not exist"
msgstr "面板目录不存在"

msgid "The panel directory holds no readable index.html"
msgstr "面板目录里没有可读的 index.html"

msgid "The panel directory was not installed from this page"
msgstr "面板目录不是本页安装的"

msgid "The panel does not answer; native_api changes need a service restart"
msgstr "面板无响应；native_api 的改动需要重启服务"

msgid "The panel files are maintained elsewhere. Updating replaces the contents of the directory with the official release after a confirmation. Set ui on the API Settings page to the absolute path of the directory, with a readable index.html in it and the fonts in a fonts subdirectory next to it."
msgstr "面板文件由其他地方维护。更新会在确认后用官方 release 覆盖该目录的内容。在 API 设置里把 ui 设为面板目录的绝对路径，目录内需有可读的 index.html，字体放在同级的 fonts 子目录。"

msgid "The panel is fetched from the official release, verified against SHA256SUMS and unpacked over the panel directory. That directory comes from ui in the honk configuration and has to be writable."
msgstr "面板取自官方 release，经 SHA256SUMS 校验后解压覆盖面板目录。该目录来自 honk 配置里的 ui，需要可写。"

msgid "The update failed"
msgstr "更新失败"

msgid "This build does not embed the panel"
msgstr "当前二进制不含内嵌面板"

msgid "Unable to determine the latest release"
msgstr "无法取得最新 release 版本号"

msgid "Unable to determine whether a newer release exists"
msgstr "无法判定是否有新版本"

msgid "Unparsable output from %s"
msgstr "%s 的输出无法解析"

msgid "Up to date"
msgstr "已是最新"

msgid "Update Panel"
msgstr "更新面板"

msgid "Update anyway"
msgstr "仍然更新"

msgid "Update source"
msgstr "更新来源"

msgid "Updating replaces the contents of %s with the official release and keeps no copy of the current files."
msgstr "更新会用官方 release 的文件替换 %s 内的内容，不保留现有文件的副本。"

msgid "Updating..."
msgstr "更新中..."

msgid "Version %s"
msgstr "版本 %s"

msgid "Version unknown"
msgstr "版本未知"

msgid "allow_origins has several entries, so listen is used"
msgstr "allow_origins 有多个条目，按 listen 推导"

msgid "from allow_origins"
msgstr "来自 allow_origins"

msgid "from allowed_hosts (protocol taken from this page)"
msgstr "来自 allowed_hosts（协议取当前访问方式）"

msgid "from listen"
msgstr "按 listen 推导"

msgid "from listen (loopback, so it only opens on the router itself)"
msgstr "按 listen 推导（回环地址，只能在路由器本机打开）"

msgid "from listen (wildcard, so the host name of this page is used)"
msgstr "按 listen 推导（通配监听，取当前访问的主机名）"

msgid "ui is not an absolute path"
msgstr "ui 不是绝对路径"

msgid "ui is set to embedded, which this build does not provide"
msgstr "ui 为 embedded，当前二进制不含内嵌面板"

